  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-02-28T01:43:14.623Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "From what I understand Udon's flexible in terms of what it can do. However, I'm working on a recreation of a Namco Wonder Eggs attraction, only under a different name and IP. It's a 28-player Rail Shooter, with analog-gun controllers for turrets. It will be VR and Quest-friendly, and accessible for Desktop, too. To make the experience as realistic as possible the \"Vehicle\" will fly in a pre-planned flight path. The object of this adventure is to destroy a doomsday weapon with said vehicle on another planet without getting destroyed or letting the weapon fire at the Earth. Is this feasible, at the moment? If not, will you add the functions necessary to make it so?",
